OL,5,G2300 A&E After Dark
OL,6,     FAn elderly man is in dire straits
OL,7,     Fafter being run over by a
OL,8,     Fmotorcycle. A man struggles after
OL,9,     Fbeing stabbed multiple times,
OL,10,     Fincluding in the neck.
OL,11,G0000 Killer on the Run
OL,12,     FThis exclusive true-crime
OL,13,     Fdocumentary tells the story of
OL,14,     FEric Frein, who shot two
OL,15,     FPennsylvania State Troopers
OL,16,     Foutside their barracks in 2014,
OL,17,     Fevading capture for 48 days.
